{"id":"A1-L077","title":"Prepositions of place: practice and contrast","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U05","focus":"Prepositions of place — prática e contraste","targets":{"grammar":"Prepositions of place — prática e contraste","pron":"r americano","verbs":["practice"],"pv":["come in"],"expr":[],"words":["sailor","captain","researcher","curator","guide","interpreter","musician","dancer","writer","reporter","announcer","camera operator","coach","referee"],"field":"Trabalho","genre":"Editorial / opinião","skill":"Leitura","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 77 · Prepositions of place: practice and contrast","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Prepositions of place — prática e contraste.","**Verbos:** practice.","**Phrasal verbs:** come in.","**Pronúncia:** r americano.","**8 palavras novas** (trabalho).","**Texto do dia:** editorial / opinião."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo contrastar in, on, at e usar come in e practice."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **ler textos curtos e achar informação (IELTS Reading, TOEFL Reading)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["sailor","sailor"],["captain","captain"],["researcher","researcher"],["curator","curator"],["guide","guide"],["interpreter","interpreter"],["musician","musician"],["dancer","dancer"],["writer","writer"],["reporter","reporter"],["announcer","announcer"],["camera operator","camera operator"],["coach","coach"],["referee","referee"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An editorial","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Where Should We Study?","paras":["Some students study **at** home, others **in** the library, and a few **on** t